  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n ({frac{1)/(6) + [ { 4(3)/(4) - ( { 3(1)/(6) - 2(1)/(3)} )} ]}}{{( {(1)/(5)of(1)/(5) ÷ (1)/(5)} ) ÷ ( {(1)/(5) ÷ (1)/(5) × (1)/(5)} )}}\n\n⇒ 1/6 + [19/4 – (19/6 – 7/3)]/(1/5 of 1/5 ÷ 1/5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ 1/6 + [19/4 – (19 – 14)/6]/(1/5 of 1/5 ÷ 1/5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ 1/6 + (19/4 – 5/6)/(1/5 of 1/5 ÷ 1/5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ 1/6 + [(57 – 10)/12]/(1/5 of 1/5 ÷ 1/5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ (1/6 + 47/12)/(1/5 of 1/5 ÷ 1/5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ [(2 + 47)/12]/(1/5 of 1/5 ÷ 1/5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ (49/12)/(1/5 of 1/5 ÷ 1/5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ (49/12)/(1/5 × 1/5 ÷ 1/5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ (49/12)/(1/25 × 5) ÷ (1/5 ÷ 1/5 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ (49/12)/(1/5) ÷ (1/5 × 5/1 × 1/5)\n\n⇒ (49/12)/(1/5 ÷ 1/5)\n\n⇒ (49/12)/(1/5 × 5)\n\n⇒ (49/12)\n\n⇒ 4.08\n\n**∴ It lies between 4.0 and 4.1**\n\ne6",
